headers {
  x-functions-key: {{functionKey}}
}

auth {
  mode: none
}

docs {
  # ws-CIR Provider conformance pass

  Run the whole folder top to bottom. Requests are ordered so that state created
  early is asserted against and then torn down at the end — a full pass leaves
  the database exactly as it found it.

  CIRIDs are supplied explicitly rather than minted server-side, because
  CreateRegistry returns no body (the spec's AcknowledgeRegistry BOD carries no
  generated identifiers either). Fixed UUIDs keep the suite deterministic.

  Operations still pending in the store return 501 with a problem+json body
  naming the spec clause. Those tests assert 501 on purpose — flip them to the
  success case as each one lands.
}
